    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"quantitative data\" approach sounds good, but we have a potential complication. Our main data processing patent is currently facing a legal challenge—it might get invalidated in the next few months. I don't want this to tank the negotiation or give them an excuse to lowball us. How do we handle this specific issue during the presentation?",
